Package: smsgora
Type: Package
Title: Client for the 'SMS Gora' SMS Gateway
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Tekservix", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"), email = "support@tekservix.com")
Description: Client for the 'SMS Gora' SMS Gateway <https://tekservix.com/smsgora>,
    which sends and receives SMS through your own 'Android' phones and SIM cards.
    Send single, scheduled and bulk messages, check delivery status, read received
    SMS, manage linked phones and webhooks, and verify signed webhook deliveries.
    A 'Tekservix' account with 'SMS Gora' and an API key are required.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://tekservix.com/smsgora/docs/, https://github.com/TekservixHQ/smsgora-r
BugReports: https://github.com/TekservixHQ/smsgora-r/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: httr2 (>= 1.0.0), jsonlite, openssl
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en-US
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
